### Depricated Replaced with Batter Auth

### Login

@baseUrl = {{url}}
@accessToken = {{accessToken}}

POST {{url}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "tod_fritsch13@yahoo.com",
    "password": "123456"
